# inc-yam9 R2: a watcher that passes its Will save against Spectral Force
# (IL_SPECTRAL) disbelieves it for itself only; the illusion stays and a second
# watcher still gets its own save. Read by tools/check_true_illusions.sh.
#
#   INCURSION_DISBELIEF_PROBE=1 INCURSION_FORCE_SAVE_ROLL=20 \
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/elf-mage-illusions-seed1.sav \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/yam9-spectral.keys 1
#
# The fixture already has wizard mode, Infinite Mana and Freeze Monsters on, and
# its spells are innate, so the cast needs no failure roll. A goblin and a goblin vizier stand 4
# squares to the right; the illusion is cast one square to the left. Walking
# into it runs Thing::DisbeliefCheck for every watcher that perceives it. SPACE,
# never ESC, clears a "-- more --".
s               # one real turn, so the load is in play
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin vizier"
RIGHT*4 ENTER
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT*4 DOWN*2 ENTER
@dump:summoned

m
@choose "Spectral Force"
c
@expect "Target Illusion"
LEFT
ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:cast
LEFT
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:after
